#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Original bilingual b196–b200. All numerical examples are declared assumptions."""
import json,pathlib,math
HERE=pathlib.Path(__file__).resolve().parent
T={t['id']:t for t in json.loads((HERE/'targets.json').read_text())};D={};S={}
def pair(z,e):return z+'~'+e
def addsource(k,z,e,p,url,scope,se):S[k]={'key':k,'title':z,'titleEn':e,'publisher':p,'url':url,'sourceType':'primary','scope':scope,'scopeEn':se}
def compact(cid,focus,text):
 units=[]
 for line in text.strip().splitlines():
  title,cause,model,measure,risk=[x.strip() for x in line.split('||')];zt,et=title.split('~');zc,ec=cause.split('~');zm,em=model.split('~');zv,ev=measure.split('~');zr,er=risk.split('~')
  units.append({'anchor':title,'title':title,'mechanism':pair(zc+zm+zr,ec+' '+em+' '+er),'model':pair('教學假設，非現場設定值：'+zm,'Teaching assumptions, not field settings: '+em),'verify':pair(zv+'同時排除以下干擾原因：'+zr,ev+' Also rule out the following competing explanation: '+er),'failure':risk,'misconception':pair('只要'+zt+'符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。','A nominal result for '+et.lower()+' removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.'),'practice':pair('交接'+zt+'時保存原始紀錄、單位與基準。'+zv,'When handing over '+et.lower()+', retain original records, units and reference conditions. '+ev)})
 assert len(units)==10,cid
 D[cid]={'focus':focus,'units':units}

compact('b196','以外水壓、有效重量與施工階段判讀地下結構抗浮~Evaluate underground uplift through external water pressure, effective weight and construction stages',r'''
外包排水體積~Displaced envelope volume || 密閉地下箱體的總浮力來自周圍水壓在外表面的合力，不能只拿混凝土材料體積計算。模型先畫出水能到達的邊界，再辨別開口進水是否改變有效排水體積。~Net buoyancy on a sealed underground box is the resultant of water pressure on its external surfaces. Concrete material volume alone is not the displaced volume. First draw the boundary accessible to water, then determine whether flooding through an opening changes that displacement. || 取水重度γw=9.81kN/m³及外包排水體積V=500m³，U=γwV=4905kN；此處假設箱體封閉且完全浸沒，並非混凝土重量。~With water unit weight γw=9.81kN/m³ and displaced envelope V=500m³, U=γwV=4905kN. The box is assumed sealed and fully submerged; this is not concrete weight. || 以竣工幾何及防水分區建立外包體積表，並用水壓積分獨立重算浮力。比對設計水位與量測孔壓是否落在同一高程基準，確認結構工程師核定的水可達範圍。~Build an envelope-volume schedule from geometry and waterproof compartments, then independently integrate pressures. Compare design water level and measured pore pressure on the same elevation datum and have the structural engineer confirm the wetted boundary. || 若以混凝土量代替排水體積，空心箱體的上浮荷載會被低估；外水回升時可能先出現接縫張開、止水破壞，再發展成整體上浮。~Substituting concrete volume for displaced volume underestimates uplift on a hollow box; rising external water can open joints and damage waterstops before global flotation progressively develops.
基底水壓分布~Base water pressure || 基底水壓由壓力水頭控制，排水管有出水不代表整片底板都處於零水壓。分層滲透與局部堵塞可形成不均勻抬升，總合力及偏心需分別核算。~Base pressure follows pressure head. Visible discharge from one drain does not prove zero pressure beneath the entire slab. Layered permeability and local blockage can produce uneven uplift, requiring separate checks of resultant force and eccentricity. || 水頭h=8m且靜水條件下，p=γwh=9.81×8=78.48kPa，約78.5kPa；水頭須從底板外側所選測點起算。~For h=8m under hydrostatic conditions, p=γwh=9.81×8=78.48kPa, about78.5kPa. Measure pressure head above the selected point on the external slab face. || 在不同排水分區布置孔壓觀測，將每點高程轉為同一水頭再繪等壓圖。驗證孔壓計飽和、零點及量測時間，不能以單一集水井水位代替全底板壓力。~Observe pore pressure across drainage zones and convert every elevation to a common head before mapping pressure. Check sensor saturation, zero and timing; one sump level cannot represent the full slab pressure field. || 孔壓計濾頭若位在排水通道旁，讀值可偏低而掩蓋遠處高壓；平均水壓看似合理仍可能漏掉局部裂縫與板角翹起的控制區。~A sensor beside a drain can read low while remote pressure remains high; an apparently reasonable average can miss the locations controlling local cracking and corner uplift.
施工重量不足~Insufficient construction weight || 抗浮不能只檢查完工樓板與覆土全部到位的狀態。開挖完成但上部結構尚輕時，外水恢復與停泵必須列為獨立施工階段，分清當時真正存在的永久重量。~A final-state check with every floor and cover layer installed does not establish construction stability. After excavation but before the superstructure gains weight, water recovery and pump shutdown require separate staged checks using only loads actually present. || 假設當期重量W=4000kN、浮力U=4905kN，未乘分項係數的比值W/U=0.815；小於1表示此理想平衡已不足，不能視為法規安全係數。~Assume current weight W=4000kN and uplift U=4905kN. The unfactored ratio W/U=0.815 is below unity, indicating deficient ideal equilibrium; it is not a code safety factor. || 逐層核對已澆置體積、實際材料重度及可依賴的荷載，將養護、回填與停泵時點排列成施工表。責任工程師應依當期水位與分項設計重新核准轉換條件。~Reconcile placed volumes, material unit weights and dependable loads for every stage. Schedule curing, backfill and pump shutdown, and require the responsible engineer to approve each transition using current water levels and factored design checks. || 將尚未施工的樓板重量提前計入，會在停電或提早停泵時失去抗浮儲備；即使最終設計足夠，施工期也可能發生不可逆接縫損傷。~Crediting future floor weight removes the apparent uplift reserve during an outage or premature shutdown; an adequate final design can still suffer irreversible joint damage during construction.
抗拔樁荷載分配~Tension pile distribution || 抗拔樁把淨上浮力經底板接頭傳到樁身及周圍土層。平均分配只是剛度相近且幾何對稱時的第一輪估算，偏心、群樁互制及接頭延性不能由平均值證明。~Tension piles transfer net uplift through slab connections into the pile shafts and surrounding ground. Equal sharing is only an initial estimate for comparable stiffness and symmetric geometry; it does not establish eccentric response, group interaction or connection ductility. || 若U=6000kN、已存在重量W=4000kN且10支樁理想均分，T=(U−W)/10=200kN/樁；實際各樁須由相容變形與群樁分析確認。~For U=6000kN, existing W=4000kN and ten ideally equal piles, T=(U−W)/10=200kN per pile. Actual forces require compatible deformations and group analysis. || 核對樁頭拉力傳遞細部與代表性抗拔試驗，將量測伸長及荷載分配和計算剛度比較。試驗方法、持荷與驗收門檻由設計及試驗工程師訂定，不以課程數值代替。~Review pile-head tension details and representative uplift tests. Compare measured elongation and force sharing with calculated stiffness; the design and testing engineers set the procedure, hold periods and acceptance limits rather than adopting course numbers. || 軟硬不均或樁頭鬆脫會讓鄰樁承受超過平均值的拉力；只看總樁數可能漏掉局部破壞，裂縫又會使防水失效並改變水壓條件。~Unequal stiffness or a loose pile head can overload adjacent piles beyond the mean; total pile count conceals local failure, while cracking damages waterproofing and changes the pressure boundary.
側壁摩阻動員~Side friction mobilization || 側壁土體能否提供向下阻力取決於相對位移、界面及有效應力，不是接觸就自動產生全額抗力。回填鬆動、滑動層或防水保護膜都可能降低可動員的摩阻。~Downward side resistance depends on relative movement, interface properties and effective stress, rather than contact alone. Loose backfill, slip layers or waterproofing protection sheets may reduce the resistance that can actually be mobilized. || 假設已證明可動員的平均剪應力τ=15kPa、接觸面積A=100m²，R=τA=1500kN；尚未驗證的接觸面不可直接套此抗力。~If mobilizable average shear stress τ=15kPa is demonstrated over A=100m², R=τA=1500kN. An unverified interface must not automatically receive this resistance. || 查驗界面材料與施工回填紀錄，將剪切試驗條件和現地有效應力比較。另列達到假設摩阻所需位移，檢查該位移是否已超過止水與鄰接管線容許變形。~Inspect interface materials and backfill records, comparing shear-test conditions with field effective stress. State the movement required to mobilize resistance and check whether it already exceeds waterstop or connected-pipe deformation limits. || 把極限摩阻當作零位移即可使用的反力，會隱藏服務性失效；結構必須上浮後才得到阻力，屆時密封接縫可能已經拉開而不能恢復。~Treating ultimate friction as a zero-movement reaction hides serviceability failure; sufficient uplift may be needed to mobilize resistance only after sealing joints have opened irreversibly.
排水失效增量~Drainage failure increment || 抽排系統降低作用水頭，但電力、濾層與排放路徑是會退化的外部條件。抗浮評估應把排水正常與失效分列，並追蹤水位恢復速度，而非只記泵浦額定流量。此處研究底板下表面水壓，須假設上表面乾燥或壓力固定；完全浸沒封閉箱體還有頂面向下水壓，淨浮力不能只取底面增量。~Pumping reduces head but depends on power, filters and discharge paths that can deteriorate. Evaluate normal drainage separately from failure, tracking water-level recovery rather than treating a pump nameplate flow as proof of uplift control. Here the lower slab-face pressure is studied with the upper face dry or held at fixed pressure; a fully submerged sealed box also gains downward roof pressure, so its net buoyancy cannot be obtained from the bottom increment alone. || 假設均勻增加水頭Δh=3m、底面A=200m²，ΔU=γwAΔh=9.81×200×3=5886kN；此為底板上表面乾燥或壓力固定時的上浮合力增量；不適用於外包體積固定且完全浸沒封閉箱體的淨浮力，後者仍為γwV。~For uniform Δh=3m over A=200m², ΔU=γwAΔh=5886kN assumes the upper slab face remains dry or at fixed pressure. A sealed, fully submerged box of fixed volume retains net buoyancy γwV instead. || 以受控情境分析比較備援供電、排水堵塞及高外水位的孔壓反應，檢查警報傳遞與值班回應時間。任何停泵試驗須經工程師批准並配有獨立監測與停止條件。~Use controlled scenario analysis to compare backup-power failure, blockage and high external water. Check alarm delivery and response times; any shutdown test needs engineering approval, independent monitoring and defined stop conditions. || 流量下降可能表示水源減少，也可能是濾層堵塞；若誤判成環境變乾而取消備援，水壓可在無出水的情況下升高並危及整體穩定。~Reduced flow can mean less recharge or a blocked filter. Mistaking blockage for drying can remove backup capacity while hidden pressure rises despite little discharge and threatens global stability.
底板局部彎曲~Local slab bending || 整體重量足以抵抗浮力仍不代表底板每一跨可承受局部水壓。簡支單向帶模型用於辨識彎矩量級，實際雙向配筋、支承剛度及裂縫寬度需要另外設計。~Global resistance to buoyancy does not prove that every slab span resists local pressure. A simply supported one-way strip estimates moment scale; actual two-way reinforcement, support stiffness and crack width require separate design. || 取淨上向壓力p=80kPa、跨L=4m與1m板帶，線荷載w=80kN/m，M=wL²/8=160kN·m每米板寬；簡支假設不含連續板負彎矩。~For net upward p=80kPa, span L=4m and a one-metre strip, w=80kN/m and M=wL²/8=160kN·m per metre width. Simple supports omit continuity moments. || 對照底板跨距、樁柱位置與實際支承條件畫出彎矩圖，再核對上下層鋼筋與接頭錨定。裂縫量測須記錄水位，讓服務性驗證與荷載狀態相互對應。~Draw moments using actual spans, pile and column locations and support conditions. Check reinforcement on both faces and anchorage; record water level alongside crack measurements so serviceability observations correspond to the applied load. || 若把上向水壓照抄成下向重力的配筋方向，受拉面可能缺筋；總抗浮比值仍正常時，跨中或支承裂縫已可形成滲流通道並降低耐久性。~Copying reinforcement orientation from downward gravity loading can leave the uplift tension face deficient. Even with adequate global equilibrium, support or midspan cracks can admit water and reduce durability.
偏心水壓力矩~Eccentric uplift moment || 不均勻水壓讓合力偏離重量中心，帶來轉動及樁頭拉力差。計算總浮力時必須保留作用位置，不能把分區孔壓平均後就丟掉偏心資訊。~Uneven pressure displaces the uplift resultant from the centre of gravity and creates rotation and unequal pile forces. Preserve load locations when summing uplift; averaging compartment pressures must not erase their eccentricity. || 若浮力U=5000kN偏心e=0.5m，附加力矩M=Ue=2500kN·m；它必須與重量、支承反力在同一參考點取矩平衡。~If U=5000kN acts at eccentricity e=0.5m, M=Ue=2500kN·m. Balance it with weight and support reactions about the same reference point. || 將孔壓分區合力與坐標同時輸入自由體圖，用測量儀與傾度計比較板面變形方向。若模型預測和轉動相反，先查感測器高程、分區連通及重量偏心。~Enter pressure-zone forces and coordinates together in a free-body diagram. Compare predicted rotation with survey and tilt observations; opposite trends warrant checking sensor elevations, hydraulic connections and eccentric structural weight. || 只將合力除以總面積會掩蓋一側先離地的情境；隨支承接觸消失，原本假設的反力分配失效，接縫張開與樁力集中會彼此加劇。~Dividing total uplift by total area conceals early separation on one side; losing contact invalidates assumed reactions, allowing joint opening and concentrated pile tension to reinforce each other.
水位敏感度~Water level sensitivity || 維護期的抗浮警報應連結水位對荷載的敏感度，而不只使用固定高程。均勻底板面積提供簡單斜率，若淹水邊界或排水分區改變，須重新建立作用面積。此斜率是底板下表面水壓對固定上表面壓力的合力增量；完全浸沒封閉箱體的頂面水壓增量須另計。~Operational alarms should reflect the sensitivity of load to water level rather than relying only on a fixed elevation. A uniform footprint gives a simple slope; changing inundation or drainage boundaries requires an updated effective area. This slope describes the lower slab-face force relative to a fixed upper-face pressure; a fully submerged sealed box also requires the roof-pressure increment. || 取A=300m²且作用面積固定，dU/dh=γwA=9.81×300=2943kN/m；假設底板上表面乾燥或壓力固定，水位每增加1m，底板上浮合力增加2943kN；固定體積完全浸沒封閉箱體的淨浮力γwV不隨此水位上升增加。~With fixed A=300m², dU/dh=γwA=9.81×300=2943kN/m. Assuming the upper slab face is dry or at fixed pressure, a one-metre rise adds2943kN to slab uplift. Net buoyancy γwV of a fully submerged sealed box of fixed volume does not increase with this water-level rise. || 以季節水位紀錄估計合理變動範圍，將量測不確定性乘上敏感度得到荷載誤差。由維護與設計負責人共同訂警戒層級及回應時限，保存每次修改理由。~Estimate credible variations from seasonal records and multiply level uncertainty by sensitivity to obtain force uncertainty. Maintenance and design leads should jointly set alarm levels and response times, retaining the rationale for each change. || 若新增鄰近抽水或外部回填改變水流卻仍沿用舊斜率，警報可能無法代表現況；高解析度感測器也不能修正錯誤的有效面積與水力邊界。~Nearby pumping or backfill can alter flow while an old slope remains in use; even a high-resolution sensor cannot correct the wrong effective area or hydraulic boundary in an outdated alarm model.
抗浮證據交接~Uplift evidence handover || 交接要同時保存永久重量、可動員抗力及高水位情境，讓維護者知道哪些能力依賴機械排水。抗力不得重複計入，例如同一土塊重量與同一滑面摩阻需核對相容機制。~Handover must preserve dependable weight, mobilizable resistance and high-water scenarios so operators know which capacity relies on pumping. Avoid double counting, for example when the same soil mass and interface resistance participate in incompatible mechanisms. || 假設同一可相容工況W=7000kN、額外抗力R=1000kN、U=7500kN，未分項餘量W+R−U=500kN；正餘量本身不等於通過所有規範。~For one compatible scenario with W=7000kN, additional R=1000kN and U=7500kN, the unfactored margin W+R−U=500kN. A positive margin alone is not full code compliance. || 用交接清單逐項核對計算版本、孔壓基準、抗拔試驗、排水維護責任及緊急聯絡程序。缺少任一控制抗力的證據時，主管工程師應重新界定可接受的使用情境。~Reconcile calculation versions, pressure datums, uplift tests, drainage responsibilities and emergency contacts. If evidence for a controlling resistance is missing, the responsible engineer must redefine the acceptable operating scenarios before handover. || 把設計圖上的抗力視為永久不變會忽略腐蝕、蠕變及排水堵塞；若責任移交未包含高水位情境，維護者可能在不知情下改變穩定機制。~Treating drawing capacities as permanent ignores corrosion, creep and blocked drains; omitting high-water scenarios from handover lets operators unknowingly alter the mechanism that maintains stability.
''')
compact('b197','從節理幾何、錨固荷載與量測基準判讀岩坡穩定~Interpret rock slope stability through discontinuity geometry, anchor loads and measurement datums',r'''
節理出露幾何~Discontinuity daylighting geometry || 平面滑動先受節理方向及坡面幾何控制，節理比坡面緩只是必要幾何條件之一。必須另外確認傾向相近、連續長度、側向釋放面與摩擦，不能把角度差當安全儲備。~Planar sliding first depends on discontinuity orientation and slope geometry. A joint flatter than the face meets only one geometric condition. Similar dip direction, persistence, lateral release surfaces and friction also matter; the angular difference is not a stability reserve. || 假設坡面傾角65°、節理傾角40°且傾向一致，幾何角差65−40=25°；此角差不是安全係數，也未檢查楔形或傾倒機制。~Assume a65° face and40° joint with matching dip direction. The angular difference is65−40=25°. It is not a safety factor and does not test wedge sliding or toppling. || 用地質羅盤或定向影像分組記錄節理傾向、傾角及延續性，對照實際坡面建立立體投影。將不可見延伸列成不確定區，由岩土工程師確認控制滑動模式。~Group dip directions, dips and persistence using a geological compass or oriented images, then compare them with the actual face on a stereonet. Mark hidden extensions as uncertain and have the geotechnical engineer identify controlling mechanisms. || 僅憑一張正面照片量角，會漏掉向側方滑動的楔體；錨索方向若建立在錯誤滑面上，外觀整齊仍不能形成有效的跨面約束。~Angles from a single frontal photograph can miss a laterally sliding wedge. Anchors designed around the wrong plane may look orderly while failing to restrain movement across the actual discontinuity.
孔壓扣除法向力~Pore pressure and normal force || 岩塊重量分解到滑面後，水壓合力會減少有效接觸力。此處假設單一平面及合力已知，張裂縫水推力與地震慣性需另加，不能混入同一孔壓數字。~Resolve block weight normal to the sliding plane before subtracting water thrust. The example assumes one plane and a known resultant; crack-water thrust and seismic inertia require separate terms rather than being hidden inside one pore-pressure value. || W=1000kN、滑面角30°、法向水壓合力U=200kN時，N′=Wcos30°−U=666.0kN；正值只表示此模型仍保持壓縮接觸。~For W=1000kN, plane angle30° and normal water thrust U=200kN, N′=Wcos30°−U=666.0kN. A positive result only indicates compressive contact in this model. || 將孔壓測點與滑面交會高程一起標示，沿面積分取得水壓合力，再與自由體圖逐項核對。若量測僅在單一裂隙，應保留其他裂隙水力連通的不確定性。~Plot piezometer positions with their intersections on the plane, integrate pressure over area and reconcile the resultant with the free-body diagram. A reading in one fracture leaves hydraulic connectivity to other fractures uncertain. || 把坡腳排水孔讀值當作全滑面水壓可高估有效正向力；降雨後上部裂隙仍蓄水時，摩擦抗力可能下降而監測畫面顯示正常。~Using a toe-drain reading for the whole plane can overestimate effective normal force; upper fractures may retain storm water and reduce friction while the monitoring display appears normal.
節理摩擦抗力~Discontinuity friction resistance || 清潔接觸、充填物與表面粗糙度決定節理的剪切行為，峰值強度不一定能在大位移後維持。模型先忽略黏聚及幾何咬合，以了解有效正向力對摩擦的作用。~Clean contact, infill and roughness govern discontinuity shear response, and peak strength may not persist after displacement. The model omits cohesion and interlocking to isolate how effective normal force contributes to friction. || 取N′=666kN、摩擦角φ=30°且c=0，R=N′tanφ=384.5kN，約385kN；此為單一滑面摩擦項，不含錨索與其他外力。~With N′=666kN, friction angle φ=30° and c=0, R=N′tanφ=384.5kN, about385kN. This is one plane's friction term, excluding anchors and other forces. || 對代表性節理材料做適用的剪切試驗，記錄含水狀態、正向應力及位移範圍。設計審查需明列採用峰值或殘餘值的理由，並和可能位移機制相容。~Test representative joint material under relevant moisture, normal stress and displacement conditions. The design review must explain the choice of peak or residual strength and demonstrate compatibility with the anticipated movement mechanism. || 試體若避開軟弱充填而只取完整岩面，會高估現場摩擦；初期穩定不能保證剪切後仍保有峰值，滑動可能在雨季反覆累積。~Samples excluding weak infill can overestimate field friction. Initial stability does not establish persistent peak strength, and repeated wet seasons may accumulate displacement after softening.
錨索方向分量~Anchor force projection || 錨索拉力必須相對於滑動方向分解，不能把整支拉力全部當直接抗滑。與滑面法向的分量可能改變摩擦，這項效應應獨立計算並避免和直接分量重複。~Resolve anchor tension relative to the sliding direction instead of crediting the full force as direct resistance. Its normal component may alter friction, but that contribution must be calculated separately and not double counted with the direct component. || T=200kN與反滑動方向夾角20°時，直接分量Tcos20°=187.9kN，約188kN；額外摩擦項在本式未計。~For T=200kN at20° to the direction opposing sliding, direct resistance Tcos20°=187.9kN, about188kN. This expression excludes any additional friction term. || 查驗鑽孔方位、錨頭偏角及滑面幾何，將竣工方向代入向量平衡。用荷載量測比對實際張力，偏斜過大時由設計者重算錨頭彎曲與可用分量。~Check drilling azimuth, head deviation and plane geometry, then insert as-built directions into vector equilibrium. Compare measured tension and have the designer reassess head bending and usable components if alignment differs significantly. || 鑽孔偏向使拉力大多沿錯誤方向作用，可能提高局部岩體應力卻未有效抗滑；只驗張力大小而不驗方位，會留下隱藏的支護缺口。~A deviated borehole may apply most tension in an ineffective direction, raising local stress without sufficient sliding resistance. Verifying force magnitude alone leaves a hidden support deficiency.
穩定區錨固長度~Bond beyond the moving zone || 固定段必須進入可承受反力的岩體，穿過滑面只是第一個幾何條件。實際黏結長度仍受裂隙、灌漿品質與鄰近錨索互制限制，自由段不得誤算成有效固定段。~The bond zone must enter rock capable of providing reaction. Crossing the plane is only a geometric requirement; fractures, grout quality and anchor interaction limit usable bond length, and the free length is not an effective bond zone. || 假設沿錨孔量得總長18m、至不穩定區末端12m，候選穩定區長度18−12=6m；這6m只是可供檢核的長度，不是已證明的黏結容量。~If total bore length is18m and the moving zone ends at12m along that bore, the candidate stable-zone length is18−12=6m. This is available geometry, not demonstrated bond capacity. || 對照定向鑽探與灌漿紀錄檢查固定段所在岩層，並以代表性試驗核對荷載、位移及時間效應。發現新滑面時必須重新定位固定段，而非延用原圖。~Reconcile oriented bore logs and grouting records with the proposed bond stratum. Representative tests must examine load, movement and time effects; a newly identified sliding plane requires relocating the bond zone rather than relying on old drawings. || 固定段若仍位於可移動岩塊中，錨索只是把不穩定塊體互相拉住；表面荷載試驗短期正常也不能證明深部滑面已有可靠反力來源。~A bond zone inside the moving block merely connects unstable rock to itself. A short-term satisfactory load test does not demonstrate a dependable reaction beyond the deep failure surface.
落石位能尺度~Rockfall energy scale || 邊坡錨固與落石防護處理不同機制，不能用整體抗滑通過取代局部塊石控制。位能估算只描述能量來源，碰撞角度、轉動、彈跳及攔截距離決定防護系統需求。~Anchoring and rockfall protection address different mechanisms. Passing a global sliding check does not control local blocks. Potential energy describes only the energy source; impact angle, rotation, rebound and interception distance determine protective-system demand. || 岩塊質量m=1000kg、落差h=20m，Ep=mgh=1000×9.81×20=196200J=196.2kJ；未扣除沿途能量損失，也未算衝擊峰值力。~For mass m=1000kg and drop h=20m, Ep=mgh=196200J=196.2kJ. The estimate omits energy loss along the path and does not give peak impact force. || 由地形測量與塊體尺寸建立可能路徑，將估計能量和經認證系統的適用條件比對。核對攔截位置、殘餘高度及支承狀態，實際評估由落石專業人員核准。~Use terrain surveys and block dimensions to define trajectories, comparing estimated energy with certified-system conditions. Check interception location, residual height and foundations; a rockfall specialist must approve the actual assessment. || 把位能直接除以任意短距離作為合格衝擊力，會忽略系統變形與局部穿透；攔網即使標稱能量足夠，位置不對仍可能被彈跳越過。~Dividing energy by an arbitrary short distance ignores deformation and local penetration. Even a nominally adequate barrier can be bypassed by a rebound if its location is unsuitable.
排水恢復摩擦~Drainage and friction recovery || 排水主要藉降低裂隙水壓恢復有效正向力，不應以出水量直接換算支護容量。流量下降可能是水位降低，也可能是堵塞，須用孔壓及降雨紀錄辨別。~Drainage restores effective normal force by reducing fracture-water pressure; discharge is not itself a support capacity. Falling flow can mean lower water levels or blockage, so pressure and rainfall records are needed to distinguish the causes. || 假設水壓合力減少ΔU=100kN、φ=30°且其餘荷載不變，ΔR=ΔUtanφ=57.7kN；未計新增黏聚或錨索作用。~If water thrust falls by ΔU=100kN at φ=30° with other loads fixed, ΔR=ΔUtanφ=57.7kN. No added cohesion or anchor force is included. || 比較同一場雨前後的降雨、孔壓與排水流量時間序列，檢查滯後及異常高水位。維護驗收以水力反應和設計目標共同判斷，不以單次通水作唯一證據。~Compare rainfall, pressure and discharge time series around the same storm, noting lag and persistent high head. Accept maintenance using hydraulic response and design objectives together rather than a single successful flushing observation. || 排水口暢通但內段被細料阻塞時，表面仍可見少量流出；若缺乏深部孔壓監測，工程師可能錯估摩擦恢復而錯誤減少其他支護需求。~A clear outlet may still pass a little water while its inner section is clogged. Without deep pressure observations, friction recovery can be overstated and other support needs wrongly reduced.
位移量測投影~Displacement measurement projection || 感測器測得的是特定方向的位移分量，並不自然等於沿滑面的總位移。解算必須知道移動方向與量測軸，若方向未知則多軸或獨立測量比單軸反推可靠。~A sensor records displacement along its own axis, not automatically the full movement along a plane. Recovery requires the movement direction and measurement axis; unknown directions call for multiple axes or independent surveys rather than one-axis inversion. || 假設真位移方向與感測軸夾60°、量測投影5mm，d=5/cos60°=10mm；方向已知且剛體移動是此簡化的前提。~With a known60° angle between movement and sensor axis and measured projection5mm, d=5/cos60°=10mm. The calculation assumes a known direction and rigid-block movement. || 先記錄感測器安裝方位，再用全站儀或其他獨立量測比較位移向量。若接近垂直投影造成放大，應報不確定性而非只增加小數位來營造精度。~Record sensor orientation and compare the displacement vector with an independent total-station survey. Near-perpendicular projection amplifies uncertainty; report that uncertainty instead of adding decimal places that imply unsupported precision. || 感測器支座鬆動或滑動方向改變，會使投影關係失效；看似位移減少可能只是方向轉變，錯誤判讀會延誤對加速變形的處置。~A loose sensor support or changed movement direction invalidates projection. An apparent reduction can be a directional change and may delay the planned response to accelerating deformation.
位移速率與時窗~Movement rate and time window || 速率必須和取樣時間窗一起報告，短暫噪聲不能直接當趨勢，長時間平均也可能掩蓋加速。監測觸發值須由場址機制、儀器解析度及回應時間共同制定。~Report velocity with its observation window. Brief noise is not a trend, while long averaging can hide acceleration. Site mechanisms, sensor resolution and response time must jointly determine monitoring triggers. || 假設6h內真位移增加3mm，平均速率v=3/6=0.5mm/h；這不是瞬時速率，也不能直接預測剩餘失穩時間。~If displacement increases3mm over6h, average velocity v=3/6=0.5mm/h. This is not instantaneous velocity and cannot directly predict time to failure. || 保留原始時間戳、缺測與溫度資料，分別用短窗和長窗檢查趨勢。獨立複測確認異常後依已核准的分級應變表處理，避免臨場任意修改警戒門檻。~Retain original timestamps, gaps and temperature records, and compare short and long windows. Independently confirm anomalies and follow the approved graded-response plan rather than changing thresholds ad hoc during an event. || 缺測後把較長間隔誤當正常採樣週期會高估速率；相反，將快速位移攤平到整日可低估加速，兩者都會扭曲應變優先順序。~Treating a long data gap as a normal interval overstates velocity; averaging a rapid excursion over an entire day understates acceleration. Both distort response priorities and engineering escalation decisions.
錨索長期損失~Long term anchor loss || 錨索長期力可因岩土蠕變、鋼材鬆弛、錨頭就位及腐蝕改變，單次初張力不是永久能力。交接應保存基準荷載、量測方法及允許的變化範圍，並指定維護責任。~Long-term force changes through ground creep, steel relaxation, seating and corrosion; initial tension is not a permanent capacity. Preserve baseline load, measurement method and permitted variation at handover, with an explicit maintenance responsibility. || 假設可比較的錨索力由250kN降至220kN，損失率=(250−220)/250=12%；比例僅描述量測變化，不能單獨決定是否重新張拉。~Comparable force readings falling from250kN to220kN give loss=(250−220)/250=12%. This ratio describes change and does not alone authorize retensioning. || 核對量測設備校正及溫度補償，連同位移、滲水與防蝕檢查判讀荷載變化。任何調整荷載方案都由錨固設計與維護工程師確認，先辨別損失來源。~Check calibration and temperature compensation, interpreting force alongside movement, seepage and corrosion observations. Anchor design and maintenance engineers must identify the cause before approving any load-adjustment procedure. || 若腐蝕減少截面卻只補回名義張力，剩餘鋼材應力可能升高；將負荷損失當正常鬆弛會漏掉破損錨頭、失效固定段或深層位移。~Restoring nominal tension to a corroded section can raise stress in the remaining steel. Dismissing loss as normal relaxation can miss a damaged head, failed bond zone or deep movement.
''')
compact('b198','校準雷達波速與定位誤差並保留地下管線判讀的不確定性~Calibrate radar velocity and location error while retaining buried utility interpretation uncertainty',r'''
介電常數與波速~Permittivity and wave speed || 地中電磁波速度隨有效介電常數改變，含水率與填土差異因此影響深度換算。低損耗、非磁性近似讓公式容易理解，強導電土層則需考慮衰減與頻散而不能照套。~Electromagnetic speed varies with effective permittivity, making moisture and fill variation important to depth conversion. A low-loss, nonmagnetic approximation simplifies the relation; conductive ground requires attention to attenuation and dispersion before applying it. || 取真空波速c=0.3m/ns、相對介電常數εr=9，v=c/√εr=0.100m/ns；這是均質低損耗假設，並非所有土層固定波速。~With c=0.3m/ns and relative permittivity εr=9, v=c/√εr=0.100m/ns. This assumes homogeneous low-loss ground, not a universal soil velocity. || 以已知深度目標或適用的多偏移距量測校準速度，在不同含水區分別記錄。比較換算深度與獨立管線資料，未校準的區段須標明速度假設而非填入精確高程。~Calibrate velocity using a known-depth target or suitable multiple-offset observations, recording wet and dry zones separately. Compare depths with independent utility evidence and label uncalibrated sections with their assumed velocity rather than a precise elevation. || 若沿用乾燥地面的波速處理濕區，深度可能系統性偏大；圖面看似連續但誤差同向累積，後續開挖判斷會錯估管線上方的保護土層。~Applying dry-ground velocity in wet material can systematically overestimate depth. A visually continuous map may accumulate consistent error and misrepresent the cover protecting a utility during later excavation.
雙程時間換深度~Two way time to depth || 雷達回波經過下行及回程兩段路徑，時間零點與天線間距需先確認。垂直入射平層模型是初步解讀，傾斜界面、近場與目標尺寸會讓簡單除二失去精度。~An echo includes outgoing and returning paths, requiring a verified time zero and antenna geometry. Vertical incidence in a flat layer is a first interpretation; tilted interfaces, near-field effects and target size can limit the simple half-time relation. || 取v=0.1m/ns、校正後雙程t=30ns，z=vt/2=1.5m；t已扣除儀器與空氣路徑偏移，並假設垂直反射。~For v=0.1m/ns and corrected two-way t=30ns, z=vt/2=1.5m. Time already excludes instrument and air-path offsets, with vertical reflection assumed. || 保留原始雷達剖面與時間零點校正紀錄，選取同一反射相位作比較。已知深度點應分布於不同材質區，讓檢核能辨別固定時間偏移與速度誤差兩種來源。~Retain raw profiles and time-zero calibration, consistently picking the same reflected phase. Spread known-depth checks across material zones so verification can distinguish a fixed timing offset from velocity error. || 忘記雙程除二會將深度加倍；若零點漂移卻只修速度，淺目標與深目標可能呈現不同相對誤差，單點校準也會造成錯誤的信心。~Omitting the two-way divisor doubles depth. Correcting velocity for a drifting time zero gives different relative errors for shallow and deep targets, so one calibration point can create false confidence.
雙曲線目標幾何~Hyperbolic target geometry || 點狀或細管目標在掃描剖面常形成雙曲線，但其寬度同時受深度、速度與掃描方向影響。用單一曲線推斷管徑與方位是非唯一問題，應保留可辨識參數的界限。~A point or thin pipe target often creates a hyperbola, whose width depends on depth, velocity and scan direction. Inferring diameter and orientation from one curve is nonunique, so state which parameters the observations actually constrain. || 均質地盤點散射模型t(x)=2√(z²+x²)/v；取z=1m、x=1m、v=0.1m/ns，t=28.28ns，約28.3ns。~For a homogeneous point-scatterer model t(x)=2√(z²+x²)/v, use z=1m, x=1m and v=0.1m/ns to obtain t=28.28ns, about28.3ns. || 以互相交叉的掃描線比較頂點位置，檢查速度固定後能否同時配合兩側曲線。將可能斜交管線或多重反射列為替代模型，不應只挑最漂亮的一條擬合。~Compare apex locations on crossing lines and check whether one fixed velocity fits both flanks. Treat oblique pipes and multiple reflections as alternative models instead of selecting only the most visually pleasing fit. || 掃描線斜交管線時曲線變寬，若一律當成深度增加便會錯置管線；過度擬合雜訊還可能把相鄰兩根管線合併成不存在的大目標。~An oblique crossing broadens the curve and can be misread as greater depth. Overfitting noise can also merge adjacent pipes into a nonexistent large buried target.
頻率與波長尺度~Frequency and wavelength scale || 高頻通常提供較短波長，但較短波長不保證在所有地盤中達到更深穿透。辨識能力還依天線頻寬、脈衝、目標對比及噪聲，不能直接把波長當精確定位誤差。~Higher frequency generally shortens wavelength but does not guarantee deeper penetration. Discrimination also depends on bandwidth, pulse shape, target contrast and noise; wavelength is not automatically a precise location-error bound. || 取速度v=1×10⁸m/s、頻率f=5×10⁸Hz即500MHz，λ=v/f=0.20m；實際解析度不是直接宣稱0.20m。~For v=1×10⁸m/s and f=5×10⁸Hz, or500MHz, λ=v/f=0.20m. This does not establish an actual resolution of0.20m. || 在代表性土區用已知目標比對不同頻段的可辨識程度，保留增益與濾波設定。驗證目標分離是否重現於重複測線，避免把影像銳化造成的邊緣當真實尺寸。~Compare frequency bands on known targets in representative ground, retaining gain and filtering settings. Confirm target separation on repeated lines rather than treating sharpened image edges as actual dimensions. || 使用高頻卻未檢查導電衰減可能只看到淺層，深部無回波不能證明沒有管線；影像看起來清晰也不代表深度轉換的速度已正確。~High frequency without an attenuation check may image only shallow layers. No deep echo does not prove no utility, and sharp images do not establish correct velocity for depth conversion.
傳播衰減範圍~Propagation attenuation range || 導電與介電損耗會降低振幅，回波還有幾何擴散與反射損失。指數模型只隔離一個衰減機制，單程與雙程必須寫清楚，避免把影像增益誤當訊號真實恢復。~Conductive and dielectric losses reduce amplitude, alongside geometric spreading and reflection losses. An exponential model isolates only one mechanism. State whether the path is one-way or round-trip so display gain is not mistaken for recovered physical signal. || 假設振幅衰減係數α=2m⁻¹、單程z=1m，A/A0=e^(−αz)=e^(−2)=0.135；雙程同深度僅此項為e^(−4)=0.0183。~For amplitude attenuation coefficient α=2m⁻¹ and one-way z=1m, A/A0=e^(−αz)=0.135. The corresponding round-trip factor alone is e^(−4)=0.0183. || 比較相同儀器設定下的振幅與噪聲底，將增益後圖像和原始波形並存。以已知目標確認有效探測深度，超出驗證深度的區域標記為未確認而非空白安全區。~Compare amplitudes and noise under identical settings and retain both raw and gain-adjusted records. Use known targets to establish effective depth, marking deeper regions unconfirmed rather than blank safe zones. || 自動增益同時放大雜訊，容易讓無訊號區出現似管線的條紋；反過來，過度濾波可抹去弱回波，使漏探被誤認為地層均勻。~Automatic gain amplifies noise as well as signal and may create pipe-like stripes. Aggressive filtering can erase weak echoes, turning missed detections into a false impression of uniform ground.
介面反射對比~Interface reflection contrast || 電磁阻抗差讓能量在介面反射，振幅與極性受材料、含水、導電性及幾何共同影響。簡式只適用法向入射的無損非磁性介質，不能用一個反射係數唯一識別材質。~Impedance contrast causes reflection, with amplitude and polarity affected by material, moisture, conductivity and geometry. The simple relation assumes normal incidence in lossless nonmagnetic media and cannot uniquely identify material from one coefficient. || 取兩側εr1=4、εr2=9，以對比指標C=(√εr2−√εr1)/(√εr2+√εr1)=(3−2)/(3+2)=0.20；符號須依電場定義校核。~For εr1=4 and εr2=9, contrast index C=(√εr2−√εr1)/(√εr2+√εr1)=(3−2)/(3+2)=0.20. Check sign against the chosen electric-field convention. || 保存天線極性與處理流程，用可確認的介面對照振幅及相位。把金屬定位、既有管圖與雷達共同判讀，對無法辨識材質的目標維持未知分類。~Retain antenna polarity and processing steps, comparing phase and amplitude on a confirmed interface. Interpret radar with electromagnetic location and existing records, keeping material classification unknown when evidence is insufficient. || 若把同樣振幅一律標成同材質，含水土界面可能被誤當塑膠管；只依顏色圖層決定施工方式，會把顯示比例造成的差異當物性差異。~Equal displayed amplitudes need not imply equal materials; a wet-soil boundary can resemble a plastic pipe. Choosing work methods from colours alone mistakes display scaling for physical properties.
里程輪定位誤差~Distance wheel location error || 里程輪把掃描時間轉成平面距離，打滑及坡面路徑會造成比例誤差。雷達深度再準確，也不能補償錯誤的平面坐標，因此定位需要獨立控制點與閉合檢核。~The distance wheel converts acquisition timing to horizontal position, with slip and sloping travel introducing scale error. Accurate radar depth cannot repair wrong map coordinates, making independent control points and closure checks necessary. || 已知路段實長10.0m，里程輪顯示10.2m，相對誤差=(10.2−10.0)/10.0=2%；若條件不變，顯示距離需乘10/10.2校正。~For a true10.0m line measured as10.2m, relative error=(10.2−10.0)/10.0=2%. Under unchanged conditions, displayed distance requires a10/10.2 correction factor. || 在已知基線做往返測試，記錄地表材質、輪徑與接觸狀況。將控制點與雷達測線同步，閉合差超過計畫容許值時重查定位而非只平移成果圖。~Run forward and reverse checks on a known baseline, noting surface, wheel diameter and contact. Synchronize control points with profiles; excessive closure error requires revisiting positioning rather than merely shifting the finished map. || 泥濘表面打滑會造成非固定比例的距離失真，單一校正係數不一定有效；若忽略局部失真，交叉測線可能錯誤配對到不同管線。~Wheel slip on mud can create nonlinear distance distortion that one factor cannot correct. Ignoring local distortion can make crossing profiles falsely identify different utilities as the same line.
速度誤差傳遞~Velocity error propagation || 當回波時間固定時，換算深度和速度成正比，所以速度不確定性應隨深度一起交付。資料處理若只報厘米小數位而不報速度範圍，會誇大成果的可信度。~With fixed echo time, converted depth is proportional to velocity, so velocity uncertainty belongs with the depth result. Reporting centimetre decimals without a velocity range exaggerates confidence in the interpretation. || 在t固定且小變動近似下，Δz/z=Δv/v；取v=0.10m/ns、Δv=0.01m/ns，深度相對變動為10%。~With fixed t and a small-change approximation, Δz/z=Δv/v. For v=0.10m/ns and Δv=0.01m/ns, the relative depth variation is10%. || 對速度建立有證據的上下界，將同一回波分別換算成深度範圍。比較不同測線與實際揭露點，若偏差隨深度增加，優先檢查速度而非任意移動所有目標。~Establish evidence-based velocity bounds and convert each echo to a depth interval. Compare lines and exposed control points; depth-dependent disagreement should prompt a velocity review instead of arbitrary target shifts. || 把每條測線獨立調速到符合舊圖，可能消除真正的空間差異；這種循環校準只證明符合先驗圖面，不能當作獨立管線位置驗證。~Adjusting each line's velocity to match old drawings can erase real spatial variation. Such circular calibration establishes agreement with prior assumptions rather than independently verifying a utility location.
深度合成不確定性~Combined depth uncertainty || 時間拾取與速度都有誤差，兩者獨立時可用一階傳遞合成標準不確定性。若同一校準造成相關性則需加入共變異，所得區間也不等於保證不會誤挖的保護距離。~Both timing picks and velocity carry uncertainty. Independent errors allow first-order combination, while shared calibration may require covariance. The resulting statistical interval is not a guaranteed clearance preventing a utility strike. || 採一階獨立誤差傳遞，z=vt/2，取t=30ns、v=0.10m/ns、σv=0.01m/ns、σt=1ns且獨立，σz=√[(tσv/2)²+(vσt/2)²]=0.158m。~Using first-order propagation for z=vt/2, t=30ns, v=0.10m/ns, σv=0.01m/ns and independent σt=1ns, σz=√[(tσv/2)²+(vσt/2)²]=0.158m. || 重複拾取回波評估時間散布，另以獨立校準估計速度變異，明列是否相關。成果表同時列深度、標準不確定性與模型限制，由管線協調人員規劃下一階段確認。~Use repeated picks to assess timing scatter and independent calibration for velocity variation, explicitly stating correlation assumptions. Deliver depth, standard uncertainty and model limitations together so utility coordinators can plan subsequent confirmation. || 遺漏速度系統偏差會讓統計誤差條看似很窄，卻整體偏離真值；即使不確定性算式正確，錯誤的介質模型仍可主導實際定位偏差。~Omitted systematic velocity bias can produce narrow error bars centred on the wrong depth. Even correct uncertainty arithmetic cannot compensate for a wrong propagation-medium model.
管線證據分類~Utility evidence classification || 管線成果需區分已獨立確認、推測及尚未釐清的目標，避免把完整彩色地圖誤當完整地下清單。雷達與既有紀錄不一致時，應保留衝突而不是以多數票決定真實位置。~Utility deliverables must distinguish independently confirmed, inferred and unresolved targets. A complete-looking colour map is not a complete underground inventory. Conflicts between radar and existing records should remain visible rather than being resolved by a majority vote. || 教學假設24個候選目標中18個得到獨立確認，確認比例18/24=75%；其餘6個仍未解，不能解讀成75%的整體探測率。~If18 of24 candidate targets have independent confirmation, the confirmation fraction is75%. Six remain unresolved; this is not a75% detection rate for all utilities. || 逐目標保存測線、坐標、回波、速度假設與確認方法，並標示未調查區及無法探測深度。開挖前由權責管線單位與工程師審查衝突清單及必要的進一步確認。~For each target retain lines, coordinates, echoes, velocity assumptions and confirmation method. Mark uninvestigated areas and inaccessible depths; responsible utility owners and engineers review conflicts and further confirmation needs before excavation. || 若把未確認目標刪掉以提高成果整潔度，接手者會誤認該區已排除危險；候選目標的確認率也無法揭示完全沒有回波的漏探管線。~Deleting unresolved targets to tidy the map implies a hazard-free area to the next user. Confirmation among candidates also says nothing about utilities that produced no detectable echo at all.
''')
compact('b199','連結內襯幾何、固化證據與長期外壓及水理效能~Connect liner geometry and cure evidence with long term external pressure and hydraulic performance',r'''
剩餘厚度判讀~Remaining thickness interpretation || 原位固化內襯需要確認結構性厚度，內膜、樹脂富集層與原管壁不一定都可計入。厚度比例只是幾何指標，承載還取決於材料、缺陷、橢圓度及原管支承狀態。~CIPP assessment requires structural thickness; an inner film, resin-rich layer or host wall may not all count. Thickness ratio is a geometric indicator, while capacity also depends on material properties, defects, ovality and host-pipe support. || 假設量得有效厚度6mm、參照原厚10mm，保留比例6/10=0.60即60%；這不是保留60%承載力，也不代表滿足最小設計厚度。~An effective measured thickness6mm against a10mm reference gives6/10=0.60, or60% retention. This is not60% retained capacity or proof of minimum design thickness. || 按位置與周向建立厚度分布，區分結構層及不可計入的內膜，記錄試片取樣方向。將最薄區與設計要求及長期材料試驗對照，不能只以平均厚度驗收。~Map thickness by location and circumference, distinguishing structural layers from excluded film and recording specimen orientation. Compare thin regions with design requirements and long-term material tests rather than accepting on average thickness alone. || 若試片只取厚實的管頂而避開皺褶或薄區，平均值會掩蓋局部薄弱；用厚度比例取代屈曲與強度分析，可能錯誤延長失效管段的使用。~Sampling only a thick crown avoids wrinkles or thin regions and conceals weakness. Replacing strength and buckling checks with a thickness ratio can wrongly extend the use of a deficient pipe section.
理想薄環屈曲~Ideal thin ring buckling || 外水壓可使內襯向內屈曲，薄環模型展示厚徑比的立方敏感度。此模型是均勻圓環且無側向拘束的理想彈性上限尺度，實際設計須另考慮長期模數、橢圓及土體互制。~External water pressure can buckle a liner inward. The thin-ring model illustrates cubic sensitivity to thickness ratio for an ideal uniform circular elastic ring without lateral restraint; real design additionally requires long-term modulus, ovality and soil interaction. || 假設E=3000MPa、ν=0.30、t/D=0.01，pcr=2E/(1−ν²)(t/D)³=0.00659MPa=6.59kPa；這不是實際管線的許可外壓。~For E=3000MPa, ν=0.30 and t/D=0.01, pcr=2E/(1−ν²)(t/D)³=0.00659MPa=6.59kPa. This is not an allowable field external pressure. || 量測實際橢圓度、環隙及厚度，取得對應時間與溫度的材料模數，再以適用設計方法評估。將理想環結果僅作量級交叉檢查，不能代替工程師核定的設計。~Measure ovality, annular gap and thickness, obtain modulus for the relevant duration and temperature, and use an applicable design method. The ideal ring result is only an order-of-magnitude cross-check, not an approved design. || 初始扁平或局部脫空可讓屈曲先在薄區發生，短期材料試驗優良仍不能排除此模式；忽略長期蠕變會高估持續外水壓下的抵抗能力。~Initial flattening or local loss of support can initiate buckling in a thin region despite good short-term test results. Ignoring creep overestimates resistance to sustained external pressure.
內壓環向應力~Internal pressure hoop stress || 受壓供水管內襯與重力污水管的荷載情境不同，不能共用同一個簡化合格判定。薄壁環向拉應力假設內襯獨立承壓，端部、接管與水錘應另列局部及瞬態需求。~A pressurized water-main liner and a gravity-sewer liner face different load cases. Thin-wall hoop stress assumes independent internal-pressure resistance; ends, laterals and water hammer create additional local and transient demands. || 取內壓p=0.6MPa、直徑D=0.3m、厚t=0.006m，σθ=pD/(2t)=15MPa；需使用一致長度單位，並另查材料長期允許應力。~For p=0.6MPa, D=0.3m and t=0.006m, σθ=pD/(2t)=15MPa. Use consistent length units and separately establish long-term allowable material stress. || 比對實際壓力歷程與端部密封構造，依合格試驗方案核對材料及系統能力。試驗壓力、隔離及排氣由責任工程師制定，本算例不構成現場加壓程序。~Compare actual pressure histories and end seals, checking material and system performance under an approved test plan. The responsible engineer sets pressure, isolation and venting procedures; this example does not authorize field pressurization. || 只按穩態壓力驗算會漏掉瞬變峰值，接管口又可能造成應力集中；內襯中段沒有滲漏不能證明端部連接及支管介面也具相同耐壓能力。~A steady-pressure check can miss transient peaks and stress concentrations at laterals. A leak-free central liner does not establish equivalent pressure capacity at end connections and branch interfaces.
厚度立方敏感度~Cubic thickness sensitivity || 內襯彎曲剛度對厚度高度敏感，局部變薄的影響可能遠大於其面積比例。比較同材料與相同幾何的厚度變動才能隔離此效應，不能混入模數及直徑的變化。~Liner bending stiffness is highly sensitive to thickness, making local thinning more important than its area fraction suggests. Compare the same material and geometry to isolate this effect rather than mixing changes in modulus or diameter. || 同材料其他條件固定時，厚度由6mm降為5mm，彎曲剛度比Dnew/Dold=(5/6)³=0.579，即約保留57.9%；D在此指板彎曲剛度。~With material and other conditions fixed, reducing thickness from6mm to5mm gives bending-stiffness ratio Dnew/Dold=(5/6)³=0.579, or57.9% retention. Here D denotes plate flexural rigidity. || 依厚度圖辨識連續薄帶，再將其位置與外壓、缺陷及支承狀態疊合。採代表性試片取得模數，並把局部剛度差納入分析而非只檢查平均材料值。~Identify continuous thin bands on the thickness map and relate them to pressure, defects and support. Obtain modulus from representative samples and include local stiffness differences rather than checking average material values alone. || 把厚度減少六分之一誤當剛度也只減少六分之一，會低估薄帶效應；薄帶若和橢圓長軸或皺褶重合，局部變形可能先主導整段失效。~Assuming a one-sixth thickness reduction causes only one-sixth stiffness loss understates the effect. A thin band coinciding with ovality or wrinkling can control local deformation and segment failure.
固化反應證據~Evidence of cure reaction || 固化不是只看表面硬化，樹脂反應可能因溫度分布、時間與材料混合而不同。熱分析估計反應進度是一種材料證據，仍需結合力學試驗與整段製程紀錄。~Cure cannot be inferred solely from a hard surface. Temperature distribution, duration and mixing affect resin reaction. Thermal analysis provides one measure of reaction progress, which must be combined with mechanical tests and full-process records. || 假設未固化總反應焓Htotal=200J/g、試片殘餘焓Hres=20J/g，轉化率α=1−Hres/Htotal=0.90；兩者須同配方及相容測試程序。~For total uncured reaction enthalpy Htotal=200J/g and residual Hres=20J/g, conversion α=1−Hres/Htotal=0.90. Both must use the same formulation and compatible test procedures. || 比對取樣點與施工溫度歷程，核對試驗基線、樣品質量與樹脂配方，另查彎曲模數和玻璃轉移行為。固化驗收依材料供應與設計核准規格，不採通用百分比。~Relate sample location to temperature history, checking baseline, sample mass and resin formulation. Review flexural modulus and glass-transition behaviour as well; cure acceptance follows approved material and design specifications, not a universal percentage. || 薄小試片可能比管底濕冷區固化充分，單一高轉化率會掩蓋整段差異；未固化區可降低剛度並增加浸出風險，表面硬度正常也不能排除。~A small specimen may cure more fully than a cold wet invert. One high conversion value can conceal spatial variation; undercured areas can lose stiffness and increase leaching despite acceptable surface hardness.
長期模數折減~Long term modulus reduction || 聚合物內襯在持續荷載下產生蠕變，短期模數不能無條件延用到長期屈曲評估。折減值受樹脂、溫度、環境及試驗時間控制，須有相符的材料證據。~Polymeric liners creep under sustained load, so short-term modulus cannot automatically represent long-term buckling behaviour. Reduction depends on resin, temperature, environment and duration, requiring evidence applicable to the installed material. || 假設短期模數Eshort=3000MPa、對應設計時間的長期模數Elong=1500MPa，比例Elong/Eshort=0.50；這不是適用所有內襯的固定係數。~If Eshort=3000MPa and Elong=1500MPa at the relevant design duration, Elong/Eshort=0.50. This is not a universal reduction factor for all liners. || 檢查長期試驗溫度、載入方式與外推期間是否涵蓋使用情境，並保存原始曲線及批次識別。若使用環境超出試驗範圍，須由材料與設計工程師重新評估。~Check whether test temperature, loading mode and extrapolated duration cover service conditions, retaining curves and batch identities. Material and design engineers must reassess any environment outside the evidence range. || 以另一配方或較低溫的數據替代現用材料，會高估長期剛度；初期驗收合格後仍可能隨蠕變失去外壓穩定，巡檢須重視逐年橢圓化。~Substituting another formulation or lower-temperature data can overestimate long-term stiffness. A liner passing initial acceptance may later lose external-pressure stability through creep, making progressive ovality important in inspection.
水理容量比較~Hydraulic capacity comparison || 內襯使管徑縮小但可改善粗糙度，兩種效應必須同時計入。滿流圓管的曼寧比值只適用坡度相同且均勻流，局部瓶頸、支管及淤積會使實際系統不同。~Lining reduces diameter while potentially improving roughness, so both effects matter. A full circular-pipe Manning ratio assumes equal slope and uniform flow; bottlenecks, laterals and deposits can make system behaviour different. || 固定坡度與滿流下Qnew/Qold=(nold/nnew)(Dnew/Dold)^(8/3)；取粗糙度比1.5、管徑比0.96，得1.5×0.96^(8/3)=1.345，約1.35。~For full uniform flow at fixed slope, Qnew/Qold=(nold/nnew)(Dnew/Dold)^(8/3). Ratios1.5 and0.96 give1.345, approximately1.35. || 比較清理前後實際斷面、縱坡與阻塞位置，以合適流量資料檢查系統水位。不能把理想容量增加直接宣稱為暴雨排水保證，還需檢查下游控制及入流。~Compare actual sections, slope and obstructions before and after cleaning, using appropriate flow data to check levels. An ideal capacity increase is not a storm-drainage guarantee; downstream controls and inflow also require review. || 粗糙度改善若只採產品宣傳值，會高估流量；局部皺褶或支管開口縮小可造成回水，即使全長平均管徑與計算比值都看似有利。~Using an advertised roughness improvement can overestimate flow. A wrinkle or restricted lateral can cause backwater even when average diameter and the nominal ratio appear favourable.
支管開口幾何~Lateral opening geometry || 重新開通支管必須辨識真實接入口，切除內襯的範圍同時關係水流、密封與剩餘結構。面積只是幾何量，接頭邊緣缺口及未密封環隙仍需獨立檢核。~Restoring laterals requires identifying the actual connection. Removing liner affects flow, sealing and remaining structure. Area is only a geometric quantity; edge notches and an unsealed annular gap require independent evaluation. || 假設圓形支管直徑d=0.10m，開口面積A=πd²/4=0.00785m²；不能把此面積直接當切割尺寸或最小通流保證。~For a circular lateral diameter d=0.10m, opening area A=πd²/4=0.00785m². This is neither a cutting instruction nor a guaranteed minimum flow area. || 對照施工前支管位置與施工後影像，記錄每個接頭的邊緣、密封及可見缺陷。任何開口修整由合格施工與檢驗人員按核准方法執行，避免依影像猜測盲切。~Reconcile prelining connection locations with postlining images, recording edges, seals and defects for every lateral. Qualified personnel follow approved restoration and inspection methods rather than blindly cutting from an uncertain image. || 錯位開孔會破壞內襯而沒有真正接通支管，過切又可能形成滲入通道；主線影像通順並不能取代每一支管的連通與密封證據。~A misplaced opening damages the liner without restoring the lateral, while overcutting creates leakage paths. A clear mainline image does not replace evidence of every branch's continuity and seal.
旁通儲量需求~Bypass storage demand || 施工期間旁通系統需要面對持續入流與設備中斷，儲量與抽送能力不能互相替代。簡單累積量適合辨識停機後果，實際應變仍受尖峰流量、上游容積及允許水位控制。~Temporary bypassing must handle continuing inflow and equipment interruptions. Storage and pumping capacity are not interchangeable. A simple accumulation estimate illustrates outage consequences, while peak flow, upstream volume and permitted levels govern the response plan. || 假設入流Q=0.02m³/s、停機t=1800s且無出流，V=Qt=36m³；此為累積需求，不能直接推成安全撤離時間或容許停機時間。~For Q=0.02m³/s, t=1800s and no outflow, V=Qt=36m³. This is accumulated demand, not an allowable shutdown or evacuation time. || 由歷史與當期流量建立尖峰情境，核對可用儲量、備援、警報與回應程序。任何切換或隔離須依業主核准方案，並確認排放路徑與周邊環境限制。~Use historical and current flow to define peak scenarios, checking usable storage, backup, alarms and response procedures. Switching or isolation follows the owner's approved plan with verified discharge routes and environmental constraints. || 將日平均入流作最壞情境會低估暴雨或排放尖峰；儲槽名義容積若包含不可用死角，實際緩衝更小，可能導致上游溢流與施工中斷。~Using daily average inflow as a worst case misses storm or discharge peaks. Nominal storage including unusable volume reduces the real buffer further and can cause upstream overflow and interruption.
材料批次可追溯性~Material batch traceability || 內襯交接應連結樹脂批次、施工記錄、取樣位置與試驗結果，讓後續缺陷能回溯到特定區段。可追溯比例只是文件完整性，不能代替材料與水理驗收。~Handover links resin batches, process records, sample positions and test results so later defects can be traced to a specific segment. A traceability fraction measures documentation completeness, not material or hydraulic acceptance. || 假設20段內襯中19段有完整可追溯鏈，比例19/20=95%；剩餘1段必須保持未結案，不能以整體比例豁免其驗收。~If19 of20 sections have complete traceability, the fraction is95%. The remaining section stays unresolved; the overall percentage cannot waive its acceptance requirements. || 隨機選取管段從竣工圖回查批次、固化曲線、試片及驗收簽認，再反向由試片找到位置。缺失資料列入交接責任表，主管工程師決定需要補驗的範圍。~Select segments and trace from as-built drawings to batches, cure curves, samples and approvals, then trace samples back to locations. Assign missing evidence in the handover record and have the engineer determine necessary supplementary verification. || 如果試驗報告與現場管段只以模糊日期連結，其他批次的合格結果可能誤套；日後發現異常便難以界定檢查範圍，放大維修與停用成本。~Loose date-only links can assign a passing result to the wrong batch. Later anomalies then cannot be bounded to specific sections, increasing inspection, repair and outage costs.
''')
compact('b200','辨別保護電流、電位量測與地下金屬腐蝕的證據鏈~Distinguish protective current, potential measurements and evidence of underground metal corrosion',r'''
閉合電流迴路~Closed current circuit || 陰極防蝕需要金屬連接與電解質路徑共同閉合，電源有電壓不代表被保護金屬收到所需電流。歐姆模型只說明等效迴路，電極極化與接觸阻抗會使現場偏離常數電阻。~Cathodic protection needs both metallic and electrolyte paths to close the circuit. Supply voltage alone does not establish current reaching the protected metal. An Ohmic model describes an equivalent circuit; polarization and contact impedance can make field resistance variable. || 假設有效驅動電壓V=2V、等效電阻R=10Ω，I=V/R=0.20A；R在此工況固定，不能當不同土壤或時間的通用值。~For effective driving voltage V=2V and equivalent R=10Ω, I=V/R=0.20A. Resistance is fixed for this scenario, not universal across soil or time. || 以經校正的電流量測與接線圖核對迴路連續性，分別記錄電源輸出、測點電位及環境條件。確認測試不改變相鄰設施的保護狀態，操作由合格防蝕人員執行。~Check continuity against wiring diagrams and calibrated current measurements, recording output, test-point potential and environmental conditions separately. Qualified corrosion personnel must verify that testing does not compromise neighbouring protection systems. || 接地短路或斷線可讓儀表顯示合理輸出卻把電流送往錯誤路徑；若只看電源電壓就判定合格，局部金屬可能持續腐蝕而沒有及時被發現。~A short or broken connection can show plausible supply output while diverting current. Acceptance based only on voltage can leave local metal corroding without timely detection.
塗層缺陷電流需求~Current demand at coating defects || 完整塗層減少與土壤接觸的面積，保護電流主要流向缺陷及裸露部位。缺陷面積比例與所需電流密度均需有證據，不能只用總金屬面積推估相同的需求。~Sound coating reduces soil-exposed area, concentrating protection current at holidays and bare surfaces. Both defect fraction and required current density need evidence rather than assuming identical demand over the entire metal surface. || 假設裸露電流密度i=0.02A/m²、總面積A=1000m²、缺陷比例fd=0.01無因次，I=iAfd=0.20A；未考慮屏蔽及電流不均。~For bare-surface density i=0.02A/m², total A=1000m² and dimensionless defect fraction fd=0.01, I=iAfd=0.20A. Shielding and uneven distribution are excluded. || 核對塗層檢查、施工損傷與接頭修補紀錄，將估計缺陷面積和現地電流需求比較。用多測點電位判斷分布，電流總量相符不能代替每個控制位置的驗證。~Review coating inspections, installation damage and joint repairs, comparing estimated defect area with measured demand. Multiple potential readings establish distribution; matching total current does not verify every controlling location. || 剝離但未脫落的塗層可屏蔽電流，增加總輸出也未必保護其下金屬；若把較大電流當絕對改善，可能同時造成其他區域過度極化與塗層損傷。~Disbonded coating can shield underlying metal despite higher total output. Treating increased current as automatically beneficial may overpolarize other regions and damage coating without protecting the shielded area.
土壤視電阻率~Apparent soil resistivity || 土壤電阻率影響電流分布，但與含水、鹽分及分層共同變化，單一數字不能直接換成腐蝕速率。Wenner模型需均質半空間與等間距，測得結果應依幾何稱為視電阻率。~Soil resistivity influences current distribution but varies with moisture, salts and layering, so one value is not a corrosion rate. The Wenner model assumes a homogeneous half-space and equal spacing; field results are apparent resistivity for the measurement geometry. || 等間距a=1m、量得V/I=R=20Ω且電極埋深遠小於a時，ρa=2πaR=125.7Ω·m；分層或深埋電極需要修正。~For spacing a=1m, measured V/I=R=20Ω and electrode depth much smaller than a, ρa=2πaR=125.7Ω·m. Layering or deep electrodes requires correction. || 使用合適電阻率儀器記錄間距、埋深、地表狀態及附近金屬，改變方向與尺度檢查一致性。若差異顯著，應用分層解釋與補充調查而非挑最有利讀值。~Record spacing, electrode depth, surface conditions and nearby metal using suitable instrumentation. Vary direction and scale to test consistency; significant differences call for layered interpretation and further investigation rather than selecting a favourable reading. || 地下管線或接地網可改變電流路徑，使視電阻率偏離原狀土壤；若直接用此值決定陽極配置，可能形成不均勻保護而且難以解釋後續量測。~Buried pipes or grounding grids can distort current paths and apparent resistivity. Designing anode distribution directly from that value may create uneven protection and confusing later measurements.
犧牲陽極壽命~Sacrificial anode life || 犧牲陽極可提供的總電量受材料質量與有效電容量限制，還要保留不能完全利用的殘餘部分。有效電容量若已包含電化學效率，不可再次乘同一效率而重複折減。~Available sacrificial-anode charge depends on mass and effective capacity, with a residual fraction that cannot be fully used. If effective capacity already includes electrochemical efficiency, applying that efficiency again would double count the reduction. || 假設M=20kg、Ceff=780Ah/kg已含電化學效率、材料利用率u=0.85、I=0.20A，L=MCeffu/(I×8760h/year)=7.57years。~With M=20kg, Ceff=780Ah/kg already including electrochemical efficiency, material utilization u=0.85 and I=0.20A, L=MCeffu/(I×8760h/year)=7.57years. || 查驗陽極材質、電容量定義及質量證明，將電流需求的時間變化納入估算。以可追溯的檢查與量測確認消耗趨勢，不能把定電流理想壽命直接作更換保證。~Verify material, capacity definition and mass certificates, accounting for demand variation over time. Traceable inspection and measurements should check consumption trends; the constant-current estimate is not a guaranteed replacement interval. || 若塗層老化增加需求或陽極連接失效，名義質量仍存在卻無法提供預期保護；只按日曆年限巡檢，會漏掉電流分配或消耗加速的異常。~Ageing coating can raise demand while a failed connection leaves nominal anode mass unable to protect. Calendar-only maintenance misses abnormal current distribution or accelerated consumption.
整流器輸出功率~Rectifier output power || 外加電流系統的直流輸出功率和市電耗能不同，整流器及線路會有損失。功率是運行記錄之一，保護是否有效仍須看結構電位與電流分布，不能由瓦數判定。~Impressed-current DC output differs from mains energy because rectifiers and cables lose power. Output is useful operational evidence, but protection effectiveness depends on structure potentials and current distribution rather than wattage alone. || 假設直流輸出V=12V、I=3A，P=VI=36W；這是輸出端電功率，不含整流器效率或交流輸入功率因數。~For DC output V=12V and I=3A, P=VI=36W. This is terminal output power, excluding rectifier efficiency and AC input power factor. || 比對經校正的輸出電壓與電流，另外量測輸入耗能，保留時間及設定紀錄。輸出突然變化應與土壤含水、接線與結構電位一起分析，由防蝕工程師核定調整。~Check calibrated output voltage and current, measure input energy separately and retain times and settings. Interpret sudden changes alongside soil moisture, wiring and structure potential before a corrosion engineer approves adjustments. || 輸出下降可能是電源故障，也可能是迴路電阻上升；只把旋鈕調高而未查故障，會掩蓋壞接點並使其發熱，卻不一定改善最遠測點的保護。~Falling output may mean supply failure or rising circuit resistance. Increasing the setting without diagnosis can heat a bad connection while leaving the most remote location insufficiently protected.
電阻壓降與極化~Ohmic drop and polarization || 結構對電解質的量測電位可能包含土壤中的電阻壓降，不能把通電時的讀值直接等同界面極化。參考電極種類、位置與切換時序決定量測意義，須完整記錄。~A structure-to-electrolyte reading can include soil Ohmic drop and is not automatically the interfacial polarization. Reference-electrode type, placement and switching timing determine its meaning and must be documented. || 若量測路徑電流I=0.20A、等效土壤路徑R=2Ω，IRdrop=0.40V；此項不是金屬極化電位，也不是可通用扣除的常數。~For path current I=0.20A and equivalent soil-path R=2Ω, IRdrop=0.40V. This is not metal polarization potential or a universally removable constant. || 以合適參考電極與同步量測程序區分通電壓降和極化反應，核對電極狀態、接觸及時間戳。有效性判定採適用標準及工程師核准條件，不提供單一跨材質門檻。~Use an appropriate reference electrode and synchronized procedure to separate Ohmic and polarization effects, checking electrode condition, contact and timestamps. Apply relevant standards and approved conditions rather than one threshold across all materials. || 如果參考電極太靠近陽極，局部電位梯度可能讓結果顯得保護充足；把這種讀值當金屬表面狀態，會忽略遠處缺陷處仍有腐蝕的風險。~An electrode close to an anode may read a strong local gradient that suggests adequate protection. Interpreting it as the metal-surface condition can miss ongoing corrosion at remote defects.
雜散電流電量~Stray current charge || 雜散直流在金屬離開的位置可造成局部腐蝕，其方向與持續時間比單次瞬時值更重要。電量積分描述通過多少電荷，金屬損失還需電化學反應與電流效率。~Stray DC can corrode metal where it leaves the structure. Direction and duration matter beyond an instantaneous reading. Integrating charge quantifies transferred electricity, while metal loss also requires reaction stoichiometry and current efficiency. || 假設同方向雜散電流I=0.10A持續t=3600s，Q=It=360C；正負交替需分方向積分，不可只用帶符號淨值推估局部腐蝕。~For same-direction stray current I=0.10A over t=3600s, Q=It=360C. Alternating directions need separate integration; signed net charge alone cannot estimate local corrosion. || 同步記錄管地電位、電流方向與鄰近牽引或工業運轉時序，辨別重複干擾。由相關設施的防蝕負責人協調測試，保留各方基準而不是單方面改接線。~Synchronize pipe potentials and current direction with nearby traction or industrial operating cycles. Corrosion leads for all affected facilities should coordinate tests and preserve baseline conditions rather than modifying connections unilaterally. || 正負電流平均接近零仍可在不同位置造成金屬溶解；忽略時序會將尖峰干擾當儀器噪聲，直到局部穿孔才發現累積的腐蝕後果。~Near-zero average current can still dissolve metal at different locations. Ignoring timing may dismiss interference peaks as noise until accumulated local corrosion causes perforation.
絕緣旁路電流~Insulation bypass current || 絕緣接頭用於控制電流路徑，但接地、儀器或金屬支承可能形成旁路。旁路既可耗用保護電流，也可能影響其他系統，任何改動需兼顧電氣安全與防蝕設計。~Insulating joints control current paths, but grounding, instruments and metal supports can bypass them. A bypass consumes protective current and may affect other systems, so changes must respect both electrical safety and corrosion design. || 假設旁路兩端V=1V、R=5Ω，Ibypass=V/R=0.20A；此電流未必到達需要保護的裸露金屬，不可全部計作有效保護。~For V=1V across bypass R=5Ω, Ibypass=V/R=0.20A. It may not reach exposed metal needing protection and cannot all be credited as effective current. || 依竣工圖辨識所有可能跨接，使用核准檢查方法量測絕緣與連續性，對照正常運轉電位。不得為改善防蝕而任意拆除保護接地，修改須經電氣及防蝕工程師共同審查。~Identify possible bridges from as-built drawings and use approved checks of insulation and continuity against operating potentials. Never remove protective grounding merely to improve corrosion readings; electrical and corrosion engineers jointly review changes. || 臨時儀器屏蔽線或支承跨接可讓原本分開的系統重新連通，造成輸出增加及相鄰設施干擾；只查主要接頭會漏掉這些不易看見的旁路。~Temporary instrument shields or supports can reconnect isolated systems, increasing output and interference. Inspecting only the main joint can miss these less visible bypass paths.
需求變化趨勢~Current demand trend || 維護期電流增加可能來自塗層損傷、土壤變濕或短路，不應直接視為保護更好。趨勢判讀需要相同電位目標與可比較的環境，將需求變化和供電設定分開。~Higher operating current may reflect damaged coating, wetter soil or a short, rather than improved protection. Trend analysis needs comparable potential targets and environmental conditions, separating demand changes from deliberate supply adjustments. || 假設可比較工況需求由0.20A升到0.60A，比值Inew/Iold=3；此三倍僅表示需求變化，不表示防蝕能力或安全程度提高三倍。~If comparable demand rises from0.20A to0.60A, Inew/Iold=3. This describes demand, not a tripling of protection effectiveness or safety. || 並排比較輸出、各測點電位、季節土壤狀態與維修事件，再決定是否需要塗層調查或接線檢查。對突然變化建立有責任人的異常單，避免只重設趨勢基線。~Compare output, test-point potentials, seasonal ground conditions and repairs before deciding on coating or wiring investigation. Assign responsibility for abrupt changes rather than simply resetting the trend baseline. || 若把每次升流都當作正常老化，塗層大面積破損可能長期不被查明；增加輸出還可能加劇局部過保護，形成表面合格但耐久性下降的情境。~Treating every increase as normal ageing can leave extensive coating damage unexplained. Higher output may also worsen local overprotection, producing acceptable-looking readings while durability declines.
年度電量與交接~Annual charge and handover || 年度累積電量支援陽極消耗與運轉比較，但缺測、停機及變動電流都會影響積分。電量不能代替有效電位紀錄，交接要連結儀表、位置、維護與異常處理的證據。~Annual accumulated charge supports anode-consumption and operating comparisons, but gaps, outages and changing current affect integration. Charge does not replace valid potential records; handover links instruments, locations, maintenance and resolved anomalies. || 假設非閏年8760h內I=0.20A恆定，Qyear=I×8760h=1752Ah；這是一年累積電量，若稱年度率才寫1752Ah/year。~For constant I=0.20A over a nonleap year of8760h, Qyear=1752Ah. This is accumulated annual charge;1752Ah/year denotes an annual rate instead. || 用原始時間序列分段積分並標記缺測，和陽極質量、有效電容量及定期電位檢測交叉比較。交接需附校正、參考電極類型及警報責任，缺失由防蝕主管結案。~Integrate the original time series by intervals and mark gaps, comparing with anode mass, effective capacity and periodic potential surveys. Handover includes calibration, electrode type and alarm ownership, with gaps closed by the corrosion lead. || 若把全年最大電流乘上總時數會高估消耗，忽略停機卻可能掩蓋保護中斷；單一年度總量無法分辨長時間低電流與短暫高電流的不同腐蝕風險。~Multiplying peak current by the full year overestimates consumption, while ignoring outages conceals protection loss. One annual total cannot distinguish different corrosion risks from prolonged low current and brief high current.
''')
